<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.367" end="00:00:01.800">Here in Oregon, these<br />are some fun words</p>
		<p begin="00:00:01.800" end="00:00:03.100">that begin with the letter &quot;j.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.100" end="00:00:04.100">(makes &quot;j&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:04.967" end="00:00:06.667">Jaw.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.667" end="00:00:08.133">Jacket.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.133" end="00:00:09.467">Jug.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.467" end="00:00:10.933">Jeans.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.933" end="00:00:12.600">Juice.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.600" end="00:00:13.867">Jet.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:13.867" end="00:00:16.667">Jam.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.667" end="00:00:18.600">Jelly.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:19.467">&quot;J.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:19.467" end="00:00:20.467">(makes &quot;j&quot; sound)</p>
</div>
